#. Tag: para
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid "Manages the Remote Control commands received"
msgstr "Xestiona as ordes de control remoto recibidas"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kded4.8.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
